<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Vakil al-Ruaya</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Regent of the People</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vakil">Vakil</a> al-Ruaya, meaning Regent of the People, was the title adopted by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/karim-khan-zand">Karim Khan</a>, founder of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zand-dynasty">Zand Empire</a>. He refused to take the title of Shah. This was a deliberate ideological choice that emphasised service to the population rather than dynastic self-aggrandisement.</p></div>
